# `vps item`: what an item asks beyond the setup questions (which follow from
# setup-custom.rules). The menu choices come first, written for each run.
撤销本工具对 ==> y
确认卸载上述软件包吗？ ==> y
每天几点自动重启 ==> 04:30
防火墙已开启，同时配置 Fail2ban 防爆破吗？ ==> y
# Worded without "防火墙" in front when asked from the single-item menu.
同时放行网站端口 ==> n
# Disk swap next to the runner's own swap.
仍然加一个吗？ ==> y
仍然禁止 ping 吗？ ==> y
# Preferring IPv4 from the single item (the setup itself answers n).
改成优先使用 IPv4 吗？ ==> y
# TG (a stand-in on 127.0.0.1 answers), the traffic alert, Docker's log limit.
Bot Token ==> $TG_TOKEN
发好了按回车 ==>
每月流量额度 ==> 1000
每月几号重置 ==> 1
计费方式 ==> 2
这个周期已经用了 ==> 5
现在重启 Docker 让设置生效吗？ ==> n
请输入端口 ==> 8080
# The parameters, asked after "3. 调整参数": the TCP cap (in MiB), then the
# TCP switches, left automatic (40 is no answer for them: asked again).
新的值（直接回车不改 ==> @seq 40 auto
只允许某个 IP 访问吗？ ==>
协议：1\) TCP ==> 1
仍然对所有人开放吗？ ==> y
确认放行？ ==> y
